<table height="400" width="550" cellpadding="5" border="0" cellspacing="5" >
<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for your interest in Arizona State University. Your application is currently incomplete and we are missing the following information:</font></div><div><br></div><div><font face="arial"><b>(INSERT MISSING APPLICATION ITEMS)</b></font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">All college and university transcripts must be sent <b>directly</b> from your school to ASU Admission Services. ASU does require an official high school transcript if you do not have an associate degree or bachelor's degree. ASU accepts hand-delivered high school transcripts from the applicant, but only in sealed envelopes. However, ASU does not accept hand-delivered college transcripts or those sent by fax. Transcripts should be sent to this address:</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div><font face="arial">Arizona State University</font></div><div><font face="arial">PO Box 870112</font></div><div><font face="arial">Tempe, AZ 85287-0112</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">As a reminder, transcripts can take 10 – 14 business days to reach ASU. Please allow ASU this time to receive your transcripts and remove them from your Priority Tasks on <a href="http://my.asu.edu">My ASU</a>.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">If you are no longer interested in attending ASU, please <a href="https://students.asu.edu/canceladmissions">withdraw your application</a>.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Please contact me with any other questions.</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">Admission Services</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div></div></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>